*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#e9eef6;color:#132746;font-family:'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif}button,select,a{font:inherit}button,select,.download{min-height:44px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:9px;background:white;color:#132746;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}button:hover,.download:hover{background:#eaf1ff}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #1d64e8;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}header{padding:16px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid #d6dfec}header strong{font-size:18px;color:#2454D6}.downloads{display:flex;gap:8px}.download.primary{background:#2454D6;color:#fff;border-color:#2454D6}main{padding:22px 24px 12px}#viewport{position:relative;margin:0 auto;width:100%;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 40px #1327461a;border-radius:8px}#canvas{position:relative;width:1600px;height:900px;transform-origin:top left;background:white}.item{position:absolute;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:-.035em;overflow:hidden;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word}.photo{padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;cursor:zoom-in;min-height:0;display:block}.photo img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.photo:hover{background:transparent}.controls{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:18px 0 8px}.controls select{max-width:min(60vw,520px)}.hint{font-size:14px;text-align:center;color:#52627A;margin:10px 0 18px}details.notes{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 25px;padding:16px 20px;background:white;border:1px solid #d6dfec;border-radius:9px}details.notes summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}details.notes p{line-height:1.8;margin:14px 0 2px}dialog{width:min(96vw,1500px);max-height:94vh;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:20px}dialog::backdrop{background:#0d1c36cc}.modalbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}.modalbar a{color:#2454D6}#zoomImage{width:100%;height:auto}.notice{font-size:14px;color:#52627A;line-height:1.6;margin-top:6px}#downloadStatus{min-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#52627A}@media(max-width:650px){header{padding:12px;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.downloads{width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap}.download{font-size:14px;flex:1;text-align:center}main{padding:16px 8px}.controls{gap:6px}.controls button{padding:8px}.hint{font-size:12px}details.notes{margin:0 8px 20px}}@media print{header,.controls,.hint,details,#downloadStatus{display:none}body,main{padding:0;background:white}#viewport{box-shadow:none;border-radius:0}}
#leaveFull{display:none}html:fullscreen body{background:#101b2b}html:fullscreen header,html:fullscreen .notes,html:fullscreen .hint,html:fullscreen #downloadStatus{display:none}html:fullscreen main{height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0}html:fullscreen #viewport{border-radius:0;flex:none}html:fullscreen .controls{margin:5px 0}html:fullscreen #leaveFull{display:block}</style></head><body><header><div><strong>THINK</strong> <span>학생 활동 안내</span><div class="notice">실제 사이트 UI 캡처 · 학생 글과 AI 대화는 발표용 예시</div></div><div class="downloads"><button id="enterFull">전체 화면</button><button class="download primary" id="editable">편집형 PPT 저장</button><button class="download" id="visual">화면형 PPT 저장</button></div></header><main><div id="viewport"><section id="canvas" aria-label="발표 슬라이드"></section></div><nav class="controls" aria-label="슬라이드 이동"><button id="prev" aria-label="이전 슬라이드">‹ 이전</button><select id="jump" aria-label="슬라이드 선택"></select><button id="next" aria-label="다음 슬라이드">다음 ›</button><button id="leaveFull">전체 화면 종료</button></nav><p class="hint">방향키로 이동 · 스크린샷을 누르면 확대 · PPT는 전체 9장을 저장합니다</p><div id="downloadStatus" role="status"></div></main><details class="notes"><summary>발표 설명 및 자료 안내</summary><p id="notes"></p><p class="notice">편집형: 제목·설명은 수정 가능하며 화면 캡처는 이미지입니다. 화면형: 슬라이드 전체를 이미지로 저장합니다.</p></details><dialog id="zoom"><div class="modalbar"><a id="fullCapture" target="_blank" rel="noopener">전체 페이지 캡처 보기</a><button id="closeZoom">닫기</button></div><img id="zoomImage" alt="활동 화면 확대"></dialog><script id="presentation-data" type="application/json">{"slides":[{"title":"AI 활용 생각 교실","items":[{"kind":"text","t":"THINK 학생 활동 안내","x":80,"y":54,"w":1440,"h":40,"size":22,"color":"#79D4D0","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"AI 활용 생각 교실","x":80,"y":112,"w":1440,"h":100,"size":56,"color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"수업에서 함께 생각할 질문","x":80,"y":218,"w":1440,"h":76,"size":28,"color":"#C5D1E4","bold":false},{"kind":"text","t":"유전 질환을 예방할 목적으로 배아의 유전자를 편집하고, 그 배아를 이식해 아이가 태어나도록 하는 것을 허용하는 데 찬성하는가, 반대하는가?","x":80,"y":325,"w":610,"h":405,"size":43,"color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true},{"kind":"image","name":"T-screen.png","x":738.7,"y":270,"w":777.6,"h":540},{"kind":"text","t":"THINK  ·  AI 활용 생각 교실","x":80,"y":852,"w":1000,"h":28,"size":18,"color":"#A5B6D0","bold":false},{"kind":"text","t":"01 / 9","x":1380,"y":852,"w":140,"h":28,"size":18,"color":"#A5B6D0","bold":false}],"dark":true,"notes":"왼쪽 목록에서 열린 단계를 선택합니다. T에서 처음 생각을 쓰고, H에서 친구 글을 읽고, I에서 AI와 대화합니다. N에서 자료를 확인한 뒤 K에서 최종 글을 씁니다. 학생 글과 AI 대화는 활동 안내를 위한 예시입니다.","source":"js/modules/thinkWorkflow.js; views/studentThinkView.html; styles/main.css"},{"title":"입장과 이유 쓰기","notes":"① 나의 생각 · 수업 질문에 대한 내 생각 쓰기\n② 생각한 이유 · 왜 그렇게 생각하는지 쓰기","items":[{"kind":"text","t":"T · 나의 처음 생각","x":80,"y":55,"w":1450,"h":48,"size":24,"color":"#0D887E","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"입장과 이유 쓰기","x":80,"y":126,"w":1460,"h":105,"size":57,"color":"#132746","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"① 나의 생각","x":80,"y":295,"w":505,"h":62,"size":32,"color":"#0D887E","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"수업 질문에 대한 내 생각 쓰기","x":80,"y":357,"w":505,"h":170,"size":29,"color":"#132746","bold":false},{"kind":"text","t":"② 생각한 이유","x":80,"y":530,"w":505,"h":62,"size":32,"color":"#0D887E","bold":true},{"kind":"text","t":"왜 그렇게 생각하는지 쓰기","x":80,"y":592,"w":505,"h":170,"size":29,"color":"#132746","bold":false},{"kind":"image","name":"T-field0.png","x":650.6563706563707,"y":254,"w":848.6872586872587,"h":255},{"kind":"image","name":"T-field1.png","x":650.6563706563707,"y":522,"w":848.6872586872587,"h":255},{"kind":"text","t":"학생 활동 화면 · 수업용 예시","x":635,"y":803,"w":880,"h":34,"size":20,"color":"#52627A","bold":false},{"kind":"text","t":"THINK  ·  AI 활용 생각 교실","x":80,"y":852,"w":1000,"h":28,"size":18,"color":"#52627A","bold":false},{"kind":"text","t":"02 / 9","x":1380,"y":852,"w":140,"h":28,"size":18,"color":"#52627A","bold":false}],"dark":false},{"title":"궁금한 점과 알아볼 방법 쓰기","notes":"③ 더 궁금한 점 · 더 알고 싶거나 확인하고 싶은 점